/* link_units.ld - the code sections of the bootloader in their original address order, one KEEP
 * line per function section .text.<symbol> (a section can also hold the next functions of its
 * group; their own lines then match nothing).  Included by link.ld (the stock image, fixed
 * addresses from 0x08000198) and by link_slot.ld (the slot images, linked from slot + 0x200).
 * In the slot build the functions the slot replaces assemble to nothing, so their lines match
 * nothing there.  The list equals the symbol column of ghidra/boot/port/units.tsv. */
